{
  "key": 5122,
  "messages": [
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00000",
      "en_US": [
        "What?! No way!\n",
        "You have the key?\r",
        "Locking the door was meaningless!\n",
        "I am the loser in this after all!\r",
        "This is no time for self-pity!\n",
        "I’ve got to alert the Commander!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00001",
      "en_US": [
        "My Pokémon can’t battle anymore.\r",
        "They’re gonna take away my Pokémon\n",
        "for messing this one up...\r",
        "Humph! Just you wait!\n",
        "Our Commander will smoosh you!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00002",
      "en_US": [
        "I’m one of Team Galactic’s three\n",
        "Commanders.\r",
        "...No, wait.\n",
        "That’s one of four Commanders.\f",
        "My name is Mars!\r",
        "We’ve been trying to create a new\n",
        "world that’s better than this one...\r",
        "But people have shown little\n",
        "understanding about what we do.\r",
        "You don’t understand either, do you?\n",
        "It’s a little saddening...\r",
        "So, let’s have a battle to decide\n",
        "what we should do next.\r",
        "If I win, you leave.\r",
        "If you win, we, Team Galactic, will\n",
        "leave!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00003",
      "en_US": [
        "Mars: Oops!\n",
        "I messed that one up!\r",
        "That’s all right, though.\n",
        "I quite enjoyed our battle.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00004",
      "en_US": [
        "Charon: My, my.\n",
        "Lose to a child, will you?\r",
        "But, no matter.\n",
        "We’ve collected plenty of electricity.\r",
        "With the power we obtained, we can\n",
        "do something quite spectacular.\r",
        "It seems quite obvious to me, Charon,\n",
        "the genius even the boss recognizes.\r",
        "Now, Mars, we should be going.\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00005",
      "en_US": [
        "Mars: Will you shut it!\r",
        "The boss is the only person in the world\n",
        "who’s allowed to order me around!\r",
        "You can keep quiet around me!\n",
        "You only joined us recently.\f",
        "Don’t think you’re important!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00006",
      "en_US": [
        "I guess it’s time to say good-bye\n",
        "and leave for the time being!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00007",
      "en_US": [
        "Team Galactic...\r",
        "They were saying they had to gather\n",
        "Pokémon and energy no matter what.\r",
        "It was for creating a new universe,\n",
        "or so they claimed.\r",
        "Nothing they said made any sort of\n",
        "sense to me.\r",
        "I can’t tell you how grateful I am for\n",
        "you saving me.\r",
        "I can finally see my little daughter\n",
        "again!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00008",
      "en_US": [
        "Little girl: Papa!\r",
        "Yuck! Papa, you’re stinky!\n",
        "Go shower now, stinky!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00009",
      "en_US": [
        "Papa: Oh, sorry! Ahaha!\n",
        "They had me working nonstop!\r"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00010",
      "en_US": [
        "Little girl: Thank you, Trainer!\n",
        "You made those bad people go away!\r",
        "I think the balloon Pokémon will\n",
        "come visiting again!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00011",
      "en_US": [
        "Papa: Oh, yes, a balloon Pokémon\n",
        "appears in front of the windworks.\r",
        "It’s always a certain day of the week,\n",
        "but I’m not sure which day.\r",
        "Could its appearance have something\n",
        "to do with this windworks using\f",
        "wind-generated energy?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00012",
      "en_US": [
        "The Valley Windworks uses turbines\n",
        "to capture energy from winds driven\f",
        "from the mountains in this canyon.\r",
        "We produce energy from the power of\n",
        "nature itself. It’s quite wonderful."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00013",
      "en_US": [
        "If the balloon Pokémon came,\n",
        "the wind would blow it away!"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00014",
      "en_US": [
        "The bringer of wars...\r",
        "Your target is the energy of the power\n",
        "plant.\r",
        "The bringer of contentment...\r",
        "Your target is the Pokémon statue of\n",
        "Eterna City.\r",
        "The bringer of aging...\r",
        "Your target is the Pokémon that sleeps\n",
        "on today.\r",
        "The dream energy.\n",
        "           Team Galactic"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "pl_msg_00000225_00015",
      "en_US": [
        "The PC screen is filled with numbers\n",
        "upon numbers.\r",
        "Better not disturb it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2BoltHoles",
      "en_US": [
        "Four bolt holes in the floor.\n",
        "The metal is scorched violet."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2Generator",
      "en_US": "The generator is still warm."
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2DragMarks",
      "en_US": [
        "Drag marks lead to the loading door.\n",
        "Something heavy went out this way."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2Cage",
      "en_US": [
        "A small cage. The door is bent open.\r",
        "A tag on it reads: PLUSLE, MINUN.\n",
        "Only one Minun is left inside."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2CageEmpty",
      "en_US": [
        "A small cage. The door is bent open.\r",
        "A tag on it reads: PLUSLE, MINUN.\n",
        "It's empty now."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2MinunCry",
      "en_US": "Minun: Minu...!"
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2MinunRanOut",
      "en_US": "The Minun ran out the loading door!"
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2WorkerDarkCoats",
      "en_US": [
        "Windworks Worker: Those folks in\n",
        "the dark coats?\r",
        "Cleared out about an hour ago.\r",
        "One of them got a call, and they\n",
        "packed up in a real hurry."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2RuthACall",
      "en_US": "Ruth: ...A call."
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2CyrusSawLights",
      "en_US": [
        "Cyrus: I saw lights here last night.\r",
        "By the time I reached the fence,\n",
        "they were loading trucks.\r",
        "I came back to tell you."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2RuthCouldHaveWokenUs",
      "en_US": "Ruth: ...You could have woken us."
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2RuthWhoToldThem",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: So who told them?\n",
        "Who could have?"
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2LedgerCyrus",
      "en_US": "Cyrus"
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2LedgerGarius",
      "en_US": "Garius"
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2LedgerRuth",
      "en_US": "Ruth"
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2LedgerBadLuck",
      "en_US": "Bad luck"
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2ReactCyrus",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Cyrus? He came back to tell us\n",
        "about the trucks. Spies don't."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2ReactGarius",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: {STRVAR_1 3, 0, 0}? He was halfway\n",
        "through the forest by then. Maybe."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2ReactRuth",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Me? I was asleep! I snore.\n",
        "Ask anyone. ...Don't ask anyone."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2ReactBadLuck",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Bad luck? An hour early is a\n",
        "lot of bad luck. But maybe."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2RuthEternaForestNext",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Whoever it was... the readings\n",
        "point at Eterna Forest next."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2RuthLookAround",
      "en_US": [
        "Ruth: Look around. Somebody here\n",
        "must have seen something."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_Arc2CyrusEllipsis",
      "en_US": "Cyrus: ..."
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_EchoHum",
      "en_US": [
        "The Resonator hums over the bolt\n",
        "holes. The air goes cold."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_EchoFrame",
      "en_US": [
        "A frame stands over the bolts.\n",
        "A Plusle is strapped inside it."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_EchoSparks",
      "en_US": [
        "Every spark it makes runs down\n",
        "into the frame."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_EchoPacking",
      "en_US": "Footsteps. They pack up in a hurry."
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_EchoCarried",
      "en_US": [
        "The Plusle is pulled from the frame\n",
        "and carried out the loading door."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_EchoMinun",
      "en_US": [
        "A Minun is left at the cage.\n",
        "It calls after them."
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "ValleyWindworksBuilding_Text_EchoFade",
      "en_US": [
        "The hum fades. Only the bolt holes\n",
        "are left."
      ]
    }
  ]
}
